{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "011min_401_2_4_011_01_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:8015f7f03497bba7a4c12f1febdbd431e93b6c415c5aa63d08d2666167cbad50",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:011min_401_2_4_011_01_09_a:2_4_011_01_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c80f911c3d3da80d5bef42d5a4d2ad76497ba0853db59b091f2ba5187d5277e4",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n现在方便吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_401_2_4_011_01_09_a:2_4_011_01_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9867cb1a879dd560560bfd46b1461ca06a83583aa6046ae47abd3e7dd993584",
      "text": "……谢谢你。\n滑雪场的那个广告反响很大呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_401_2_4_011_01_09_a:2_4_011_01_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee3f6e95426054a0c02ed72d05e10c7512e17ed8a2952215a33380e265f64960",
      "text": "前几天偶然路过海报前，\n看到有粉丝女孩子们在拍照呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_401_2_4_011_01_09_a:2_4_011_01_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ebb98bc0c108697a0b872895b8e027fac50fd928f0b7e1d4ceb20afc153b778",
      "text": "而且滑雪场看起来\n也热闹非凡，真让人高兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_401_2_4_011_01_09_a:2_4_011_01_09_a:cmd-000014:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8df078f57e7a01e62f11bf2a9f40807f525b37459aa327c40e9f18eb70abf64",
      "text": "那真是太让人高兴了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_401_2_4_011_01_09_a:2_4_011_01_09_a:cmd-000015:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9089491c402ebd3e0e0cd735fd392a242977b968ff7189e3b3e92a128a9ce34a",
      "text": "毕竟是很棒的\n广告嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_401_2_4_011_01_09_a:2_4_011_01_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad39b920c7294b2a1ceb239545de1ed959c259b1aeadf9ee6049bad7ff8639af",
      "text": "我的工作能给别人带来笑容、\n能派上用场，我感到很开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_401_2_4_011_01_09_a:2_4_011_01_09_a:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72081fc45d49a51f4b0f251bf75fe067dcc492f22961eece8f31a85b740b5339",
      "text": "谢谢你为我接下这么棒的工作。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_401_2_4_011_01_09_a:2_4_011_01_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4699698b5fad1bb147505cbe1b06dde3ae5ea77db6540e722364888187841c9a",
      "text": "今后为了能展现出超出制作人期待的成果，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_401_2_4_011_01_09_a:2_4_011_01_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38d5cdb253079ba2c1f3713b51a8c77c0b2097a1d12d1ab730ee782489babde9",
      "text": "为了能让粉丝们一直对我说喜欢，\n我也会按自己的方式继续努力的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_401_2_4_011_01_09_a:2_4_011_01_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbd84a378b855821b03a9db383a740a5a3c49eb09ccbc32f7ba9ccc8174b0c81",
      "text": "所以说，下一份工作也拜托了哦。\n一起打造出好作品呈现给所有人吧。那就先这样。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
